    "Set how long to wait for the AI provider to respond. If no response is received within this duration, you can either fail immediately and paste the original transcription, or retry the request up to 3 attempts." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lege fest, wie lange auf eine Antwort des KI-Anbieters gewartet werden soll. Wenn innerhalb dieser Dauer keine Antwort eingeht, kannst du entweder sofort abbrechen und die ursprüngliche Transkription einfügen oder die Anfrage bis zu 3-mal wiederholen."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "设置等待 AI 提供商响应的时长。如果在该时长内未收到响应，你可以选择立即失败并粘贴原始转写内容，或重试请求（最多 3 次）。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "設定等待 AI 供應商回應的時間。如果在該時間內未收到回應，你可以選擇立即失敗並貼上原始轉錄內容，或重試請求（最多 3 次）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Set how Wa-Gong transcribes and formats your speech, then start dictating in any app." : {
      "comment" : "Description of the empty state shown before the user creates a mode.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lege fest, wie Wa-Gong deine Sprache transkribiert und formatiert, und diktiere dann in jeder App."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "设置 Wa-Gong 如何转写和格式化你的语音，然后即可在任何 App 中开始听写。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "設定 Wa-Gong 如何轉錄和格式化你的語音，然後即可在任何 App 中開始聽寫。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
