    "Wa-Gong app is not available" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wa-Gong-App ist nicht verfügbar"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wa-Gong App 不可用"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wa-Gong App 不可用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wa-Gong automatically understands what you are working with and selects your preferred setup. You can always configure this by editing or creating new modes." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wa-Gong erkennt automatisch, woran du arbeitest, und wählt deine bevorzugte Konfiguration aus. Du kannst dies jederzeit anpassen, indem du Modi bearbeitest oder neue erstellst."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wa-Gong 会自动识别你正在处理的内容，并选用你偏好的设置。你随时可以通过编辑或创建新模式来进行配置。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wa-Gong 會自動辨識你正在處理的內容，並選用你偏好的設定。你隨時可以通過編輯或建立新模式來進行設定。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wa-Gong can select the right mode from the app you are using and the rules you configure." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wa-Gong kann anhand der verwendeten App und der konfigurierten Regeln den passenden Modus auswählen."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wa-Gong 可以根据你正在使用的 App 和你配置的规则选择合适的模式。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wa-Gong 可以根據你正在使用的 App 和你設定的規則選擇合適的模式。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wa-Gong could not switch to another microphone." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wa-Gong konnte nicht zu einem anderen Mikrofon wechseln."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wa-Gong 无法切换到其他麦克风。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wa-Gong 無法切換到其他麥克風。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wa-Gong couldn't access its storage location. Your transcriptions will not be saved between sessions." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wa-Gong konnte nicht auf den Speicherort zugreifen. Deine Transkriptionen werden nicht zwischen Sitzungen gespeichert."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wa-Gong 无法访问其存储位置。你的转写记录将无法跨会话存储。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wa-Gong 無法存取其儲存位置。你的轉錄記錄將無法跨工作階段儲存。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wa-Gong couldn't access the macOS Keychain. Quit and reopen Wa-Gong. If the problem continues, restart your Mac." : {
      "comment" : "Error message displayed when the macOS Keychain is unavailable.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wa-Gong konnte nicht auf den macOS-Schlüsselbund zugreifen. Beende Wa-Gong und öffne die App erneut. Falls das Problem weiterhin besteht, starte deinen Mac neu."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wa-Gong 无法访问 macOS 钥匙串。请退出并重新打开 Wa-Gong。如果问题仍然存在，请重新启动 Mac。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wa-Gong 無法存取 macOS 鑰匙圈。請結束並重新開啟 Wa-Gong。如果問題仍然存在，請重新啟動 Mac。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
